# Facts about Mir Ten (they/them).
# Formerly "Mira" (id `mira`); renamed 2026-10-15. See the note on `@npc mir` in cast.grim.

@fact mir.artificer
tier: surface
text: An artificer who smells of solder and ozone and has started at least one small fire.

@fact mir.owl
tier: personal
hint: Ask what their clockwork owl remembers.
unlock: seen(mir_owl_gift) > 0
text: Built a clockwork owl that remembers deadlines, birthdays and, slightly, grudges.

@fact mir.notebooks
tier: personal
hint: Get close enough to be shown the notebooks.
unlock: rel(mir) >= 12
text: Three years of notebooks are the most precious things they own.

@fact mir.family
tier: personal
hint: Ask about the family business.
unlock: seen(mir_family_business) > 0
text: Their family runs a clockworks and thinks invention is a hobby. It is not a hobby.

@fact mir.name_day
tier: secret
hint: Find out when their name day is.
unlock: seen(mir_name_day) > 0
text: Nobody ever remembered their name day before.

@fact mir.workshop
tier: personal
hint: Count the fires this term.
unlock: seen(mir_workshop_closed) > 0
text: After the third fire in a term, the faculty padlocked their workshop.
